- Remove the framed icon box around the brand mark (designed for the old reticle)
- Header mark 44px, footer 36px, About/Visibility eyebrow 26px
- Wordmark accent uses new --brand-blue (#149FE6) token to match the logo
- Header height unchanged (68px); mobile verified

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YTqriFcoGbKf8UugCsc6PQ
